    { 10, 4, "Gan'rul's Summons (Orc/Troll, level 10): talk to Ophek in Razor Hill, then to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar. Then Creature of the Void: recover the Tablet of Verga for Gan'rul (Skull Rock ). Then The Binding: use the Glyphs of Summoning to summon and subjugate a Voidwalker, bring the glyphs back to Gan'rul. Reward: Summon Voidwalker ." },
