    { 20, 7, "Devourer of Souls (Orc/Troll, Succubus): talk to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar, then to Cazul in the Cleft of Shadow. Then News of Dogran: talk to Zankaja (Orgrimmar) and Gazrog (Crossroads), then to Ken'zigla at Malaka'jin order. Then Love's Gift: bring the Dirt-caked Pendant to Gan'rul (from Grunt Dogran, Agama'gor). Finally The Binding: use Dogran's Pendant to summon and subjugate a Succubus, bring the pendant back to Gan'rul. Reward: Summon Succubus ." },
    { 20, 7, "Love Hurts (Orc/Troll, Incubus): talk to Cazul in Orgrimmar, then to Magar in Orgrimmar. Then The Binding: use the Withered Scarf to summon and subjugate an Incubus, bring the scarf back to Gan'rul Bloodeye. Reward: Summon Incubus ." },
    { 20, 7, "The Orb of Soran'ruk (from Doan Karhan, The Barrens 49.2 57.2): bring 3 Soran'ruk Fragments from the Twilight Acolytes in Blackfathom Deeps and 1 Large Soran'ruk Fragment from the Shadowfang Darksoul in Shadowfang Keep. Choose between Staff of Soran'ruk (2H) and Orb of Soran'ruk (off-hand)." },
