    { 20, 7, "Love Hurts (Orc/Troll, Incubus): talk to Cazul in Orgrimmar, then to Magar in Orgrimmar. Then The Binding: use the Withered Scarf to summon and subjugate an Incubus, bring the scarf back to Gan'rul Bloodeye. Reward: Summon Incubus ." },
