    {  } },
   { "Ruins of Lordaeron", 15, 20, "opt", "17–19", "Only if you are already nearby: it is far, and rough below 17.", "Outside Undercity, Tirisfal Glades (72.4 11.6): before the keep, up the stairs on the left.",
